thinking
**Identifying borrow/move conflict in match**

Noticed that matching on `action.as_str()` borrows `action` for the whole match, so moving `action` inside any branch causes borrow checker errors; planning to fix this by cloning `action` when passing into requests to avoid ownership conflicts.
